<title>CYPRUS: Rate on Cyprus 91-day bills steady at 6.048 pct.</title>
<headline>Rate on Cyprus 91-day bills steady at 6.048 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Cyprus sold 11.0 million pounds ($23.5 million) of 91-day treasury bills with a coupon of 6.048 percent, unchanged from the previous auction on December 11.</p>
<p>A Central Bank statement issued on Friday said it had offered up to 20 million pounds in bills. It received bids totalling 11.0 million pounds. ($=0.47 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
